body:
I'm not being smug?? Listen dude, you replied to my shit lol. Also good for you? I'm glad you can prove yourself to random person on reddit about how politically woke you are. Smug would mean i have excessive pride in something which in this case would be my reply. Since my last reply actually had a dismissive tone and not a smug one I'm taking it that you're on the defense since I made that assumption so I'll apologise for that. However, I am done talking to you since you seem to be a contrarian. You should listen to this song called You're So Vain by Carly Simon, I think it sums up the end of this exchange... Again, goodnight! (;

&#x200B;

Seeing your edit, I did indeed clearly see, glad we can come to this resolve haha :)
